    "SERIES": "2026-Q1 Babel",
    "WORD": "NIMROD",
    "GLOSS": "A mighty hunter and rebellious king who founded the first empire at Babel.",
    "CARD_TYPE": "NAME",
    "RARITY_TEXT": "RARE",
    "RARITY_ICON": "RARE",
    "ART_PROMPT": "A powerful ancient Mesopotamian king in royal armor holding a bow, standing on a balcony overlooking a massive ziggurat under construction in a desert city. Golden hour lighting, lion motifs on the armor.",
    "ABILITY_TEXT": "Target player reveals their hand. You may take a NAME from their hand and add it to your own.",
    "STAT_LORE": 4,
    "STAT_CONTEXT": 3,
    "STAT_COMPLEXITY": 3,
    "OT_VERSE_REF": "Genesis 10:9",
    "OT_VERSE_SNIPPET": "He was a mighty hunter before the Lord; therefore it is said, 'Like Nimrod the mighty hunter before the Lord.'",
    "NT_VERSE_REF": "Revelation 17:5",
    "NT_VERSE_SNIPPET": "And on her forehead a name was written: MYSTERY, BABYLON THE GREAT, THE MOTHER OF HARLOTS...",
    "OT_VERSE_LINE": "Genesis 10:9 — “He was a mighty hunter before the Lord; therefore it is said, 'Like Nimrod the mighty hunter before the Lord.'”",
    "NT_VERSE_LINE": "Revelation 17:5 — “And on her forehead a name was written: MYSTERY, BABYLON THE GREAT, THE MOTHER OF HARLOTS...”",
    "GREEK": "Νεβρώδ",
